8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I find Shizue’s sudden warmth a bit theatrical. Minako, your question was clever, but perhaps too open for day zero.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
